# Recipe of the Play 6 updater (decision 2026-11-10, Q1), read by
# tools/devices/assemble_app.py. The Z9X updater is the base; apps/Play6Updater is only the Play 6 layer: the
# recovery-block install (Engine, UpdateService, UpdateManifest, Preflight), the ro.lumen.* properties and the play6
# channel without a beta channel (Ota), the consent texts of the recovery install (UpdaterActivity, strings), the
# system uid and RECOVERY (AndroidManifest), its tests. Each of them has a row in tools/play6/forks.tsv. Statistics,
# the one-time notice, the channel logic and the rest come from apps/Z9xUpdater unchanged.
# tools/play6/build_play6.sh and tools/arch/baseline.sh build the assembled tree.
app       Play6Updater
base      apps/Z9xUpdater
module    lumen-stats
top       apps/Play6Updater
skip      build/ tools/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md .DS_Store
identical error
